<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-8331] SQL: Add Decimal precision and scale constraint</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-8331</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;We should support DECIMAL(X, Y) syntax. &lt;br/&gt;
Currently, we ignore it. &lt;br/&gt;
It affects semantics. &lt;br/&gt;
E.g., one can insert a DECIMAL with greater precision into a cache/table without any problems. &lt;/p&gt;</description>
