&lt;p&gt;Hello, &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=vozerov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;vozerov&quot;&gt;vozerov&lt;/a&gt;. Can you take a look at new SQL error codes? Are they make sense to you?&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I want to merge this PR if you have no objections.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Declaration - &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/4689/files#diff-5b413c984e074a6d507f37edb258d37eR110&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/4689/files#diff-5b413c984e074a6d507f37edb258d37eR110&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
